            "requirement": "The author TRANSLATES the blueprint; it does NOT re-decide it. The blueprint (Step 5) already fixed lane/gate/placement/want/hook; a MISSING decision is a STOP — bounce to Blueprint, do not improvise. Pull the scene's lane/gate/placement/want/hook from design_book.md rather than improvising cold.",
            "citation": "beat-authoring.md:88-92, 107-112; step-5-blueprint.md:1-13",
            "verbatim": "**Translate the blueprint; don't re-decide it** (a missing decision is a stop — bounce to Blueprint, don't improvise)."
