            "citation": "beat-authoring.md:192-194 (frontier), 230-232 (legibility cross-gate); lanes.md:120-128 (locked-visible ladder); step-2-toplevel.md:181-184 (D3)",
            "verbatim": "beats beyond the current frontier are **telegraphed locked-visible seeds**, never silent gaps ... a silent cross-lock is a soft-lock."
