            "citation": "step-2-toplevel.md:166 (form 3 = G6); beat-authoring.md:184 (Form 3 = G6 not yet authored); lanes.md:233-234 (two-NPC co-presence needs an engine feature)",
            "verbatim": "(Form 3 — a finished arc *producing* income/capability — is **G6**, not yet authored.) ... two-NPC co-presence ... needs a separate engine feature the renderer doesn't have yet"
          },
