    spine: { type: 'string', description: 'the two-axis spine — relation (earn access to the office) + Renner corruption (the seduction rungs); the DOUBLE-LOCK VARIANT (player has NO corruption door — inverted protagonist; so lewd rungs lock on relation + Renner-corruption, both NPC axes)' },
